it was listed in the Kbuild file.

Fixes: b72e7464e4cf ("x86/uapi: Do not export <asm/msr-index.h> as part of the user API headers")
Suggested-by: Borislav Petkov <bp@alien8.de>
CC: Ingo Molnar <mingo@kernel.org>
